{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the mysteries of the Bible with **Bible Trivia**!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an immersive journey through Scripture. With over 1,500 handcrafted questions, stunning visuals, and original music, Bible Trivia lets you explore biblical stories, parables, and teachings in a completely new way.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can now **chat with Moses** \u2014 and soon, with other historical figures like David, Paul, and even Jesus! Dive into a unique spiritual adventure unlike anything you've played before.</p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578400/extras/a44787d3625edb37befac37b7eda0810.poster.avif?t=1763152848\" width=610 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578400/extras/a44787d3625edb37befac37b7eda0810.webm?t=1763152848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Highlights:</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udde3 Chat with Biblical Figures:</strong> Interact with Moses and uncover deeper insights into his journey. More characters like Abraham, Joseph, Noah, Paul, and Jesus are coming soon.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578400/extras/d329f1f71b652ba735a621e8e9910e32.poster.avif?t=1763152848\" width=568 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578400/extras/d329f1f71b652ba735a621e8e9910e32.webm?t=1763152848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2b50 Star-Based Progression:</strong> Earn stars by answering questions and unlock new Bible chapters. Master each book and grow in your knowledge of Scripture.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d Now in More Languages:</strong> Play in English, Spanish, Russian \u2014 and more to come! Join our growing global community.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfad Custom Avatars:</strong> Personalize your gameplay by choosing from a variety of avatars that reflect your personality.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578400/extras/aa882fc2a2041e02fc8674b12c08e4d2.poster.avif?t=1763152848\" width=610 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578400/extras/aa882fc2a2041e02fc8674b12c08e4d2.webm?t=1763152848\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcdc Themed Cards to Collect:</strong> Unlock beautiful themed cards featuring prophets, kings, priests, and Christ\u2019s disciples by answering questions in specific chapters.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcbe Custom Save Slots:</strong> Use up to three separate save files to track your progress however you like.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfaf Strategic Gameplay:</strong> Use bonus items like Time Extenders and Star Multipliers to conquer harder challenges.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Rewards &amp; Milestones:</strong> Earn coins and reach major achievements as you progress \u2014 your dedication and knowledge won\u2019t go unnoticed.</p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2578400/extras/7d58a32ce07cd8008404c6554d2e3c2a.poster.avif?t=1763152848\" width=585 height=115 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.